@base = http://localhost:4000

### Register
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alan@test1.com", "password": "Test1234" }

### Verify (put the code from Mailpit here)
POST {{base}}/auth/verify-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alan@test1.com", "code": "368194" }

### Resend code
POST {{base}}/auth/resend-otp
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alan@test.com" }

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "alan@test.com", "password": "Test1234" }

### Validation error example
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "not-an-email", "password": "abc" }
